have chips in them.

00:05:04.901 --> 00:05:06.033
And then Dilbert would say
what flavor are they?

00:05:06.033 --> 00:05:08.100
Ranch or sour cream?

00:05:08.100 --> 00:05:10.300
Which is why
I'm team Peanuts all the way.

00:05:10.300 --> 00:05:13.400
Lucy would never have stood
for this [bleep].

00:05:13.400 --> 00:05:14.834
If she had to deal
with the modern GOP,

00:05:14.834 --> 00:05:16.400
she'd reopen
her psychiatry booth

00:05:16.400 --> 00:05:19.300
and jack the fee up
to 15 cents.

00:05:19.300 --> 00:05:21.634
You know what? I think we maybe
landed that tangent.

00:05:21.634 --> 00:05:23.767
Could we get a score
from the judges?

00:05:23.767 --> 00:05:25.667
A three?!

00:05:25.667 --> 00:05:27.100
Sure, but you're biased.

00:05:27.100 --> 00:05:29.167
The point, once again, is that
while Democrats were focused

00:05:29.167 --> 00:05:32.267
