friends are talking about.

00:05:55.868 --> 00:05:57.167
I couldn't see it.

00:05:57.167 --> 00:05:58.601
I tried to freeze frame,

00:05:58.601 --> 00:06:02.434
but I didn't see the violence
being talked about.

00:06:02.434 --> 00:06:05.601
These are our elected
representatives

00:06:05.601 --> 00:06:07.133
and they sound like grandpas

00:06:07.133 --> 00:06:10.567
