the cat fall off the sofa.

00:06:16.467 --> 00:06:21.367
Then I tried to freeze frame.
I took a picture of my thumb.

00:06:21.367 --> 00:06:23.934
And then there was Matt Gaetz
who tried to dismiss the video

00:06:23.934 --> 00:06:26.868
in question as just a cartoon
