I'm a different one.

00:07:18.234 --> 00:07:20.767
Look, am I going to get
this bank loan or not?

00:07:20.767 --> 00:07:22.767
But here's
the more important point.

00:07:26.167 --> 00:07:28.067
Don't tell anyone
